We have taken advantage of the situation and have awoken the class consciousness of the white collar workers. Increasingly, they flock to our party and [? if aufhauser_advisor: thanks to Aufhäuser's skills, ?] more white collar workers have joined the AfA-bund.

By awakening the class consciousness of the new middle class, they have been removed from the secondary burdens. Pro-labor policies and radical left-wing policies, with the exception of raising taxes, can win their support. In addition, our media campaigning and rallies will have more of an effect amongst the new middle class, now that they are conscious. 

